    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_right_sidebar\" ac:breakout-mode=\"default\"><ac:layout-cell><h2>About the Feature</h2><p>Invoice created for a service such as registration fees or consultation fees can be refunded back through &ldquo;Refund Invoice&rdquo; feature in Odoo. This feature is used by hospital receptionist, front desk or any authorised billing clerk in the hospital.</p><ac:adf-extension><ac:adf-node type=\"panel\"><ac:adf-attribute key=\"panel-type\">note</ac:adf-attribute><ac:adf-content><p>To refund invoice of a stockable product such as drug or consumable the steps are a bit different because it involves return of the products as well. Refer to <ac:link ac:card-appearance=\"inline\"><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Returning the delivered medicine and Refunding the Invoice\" ri:version-at-save=\"2\" /><ac:link-body>Returning the delivered medicine and Refunding the Invoice</ac:link-body></ac:link> </p></ac:adf-content></ac:adf-node><ac:adf-fallback><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" style=\"background-color: rgb(234,230,255);border-color: rgb(153,141,217);border-width: 1.0px;\"><div class=\"panelContent\" style=\"background-color: rgb(234,230,255);\">\n<p>To refund invoice of a stockable product such as drug or consumable the steps are a bit different because it involves return of the products as well. Refer to <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/1177190402/Returning+the+delivered+medicine+and+Refunding+the+Invoice\">Returning the delivered medicine and Refunding the Invoice</a> </p>\n</div></div></ac:adf-fallback></ac:adf-extension><ac:adf-extension><ac:adf-node type=\"panel\"><ac:adf-attribute key=\"panel-type\">note</ac:adf-attribute><ac:adf-content><p>The following steps and screenshots are explained as per Odoo 10, available on Bahmni 0.92 release.</p></ac:adf-content></ac:adf-node><ac:adf-fallback><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" style=\"background-color: rgb(234,230,255);border-color: rgb(153,141,217);border-width: 1.0px;\"><div class=\"panelContent\" style=\"background-color: rgb(234,230,255);\">\n<p>The following steps and screenshots are explained as per Odoo 10, available on Bahmni 0.92 release.</p>\n</div></div></ac:adf-fallback></ac:adf-extension><h2>How is it Used?</h2><ol><li><p>To refund the invoice, click on the &ldquo;Invoices&rdquo; button appearing at the top right side of the screen for a confirmed sales order in Odoo.</p><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"405\" ac:original-width=\"812\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image-20200401-085542.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image><p /></li><li><p>Click on the &ldquo;Refund Invoice&rdquo; button appearing at the top left side of the screen.</p><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"363\" ac:original-width=\"787\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image-20200401-090004.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image><p /></li><li><p>Select the desired &ldquo;Refund Method&rdquo; in the &ldquo;Refund Invoice&rdquo; popup.</p></li><li><p>Enter the Refund Reason and Date in the respective fields accordingly and click on the &ldquo;Create Refund&rdquo; button at the bottom left side of the popup.</p><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"235\" ac:original-width=\"891\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image-20200401-090418.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image><p /></li><li><p>Open the Draft Refund record, click on the &ldquo;Validate&rdquo; button appearing at the top right side of the screen and then click on the &ldquo;Register Payment&rdquo; button.</p><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"360\" ac:original-width=\"794\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image-20200401-090809.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image><p /></li><li><p>Select the Payment Journal and enter the Payment Amount in the respective fields under &ldquo;Register Payment&rdquo; popup and then click on &ldquo;Validate&rdquo; button appearing at the bottom left side of the popup.</p><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"238\" ac:original-width=\"575\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image-20200401-091253.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image><p /></li><li><p>You can print the Refund Invoice by clicking the &ldquo;Print&rdquo; button and selecting the &ldquo;Invoices&rdquo; option.</p></li></ol></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"toc\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" data-layout=\"default\" ac:macro-id=\"97841809-7660-4807-a642-6dcf526821b6\" /><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"46ede77d-345f-411e-bd37-963aa7978441\"><ac:rich-text-body><p><strong>Feature Details</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32604217/Patient+Billing+and+Accounting\">Feature Guide - Patient Billing and Accounting</a> </p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"6103a9c4-52fc-4a6a-9df3-2dd35c972fc4\"><ac:rich-text-body><p><strong>Implementation Details</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/900464675/Odoo+Sales+Configuration\">Implementer's Guide - Odoo modules - Odoo Sales Configuration</a> </p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section></ac:layout>",
